  "ingredients": [
    "2 quarts vanilla ice cream, softened, or as needed",
    "8 large egg whites",
    "0.125 teaspoon cream of tartar",
    "0.125 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 8-inch round prepared white cake layer"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vrUN-oG7NYjhKTrCO1W1w0IbsJI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18986-baked-alaska-ddmfs-041-step1-847f8d7d42d54616af69cf5040b0286e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18986/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line the bottom and sides of an 8-inch round mixing bowl with plastic wrap. Pack softened ice cream into the prepared bowl, then flatten the top and cover with more plastic wrap. Freeze until firm, 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MsEh7vbwqmriZTvj4YKJCVAyWWU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18986-baked-alaska-ddmfs-042-step2-90ba13984e60434db2a243f0433c81b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18986/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg whites, sugar, cream of tartar, and salt in a mixing bowl until stiff peaks form.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gkqSj7S0IJPD9zYnfMXK_JkuppA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18986-baked-alaska-ddmfs-043-step3-68607783b6e4433d8fb707ebd7875e98.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18986/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper and place cake in the center. Remove ice cream from the freezer, discard plastic wrap, and turn ice cream out on top of cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rb3c9rEo7SiCqaVTvXbfp0JR1a8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18986-baked-alaska-ddmfs-044-step4-ce6a5d4bdae34fb0addd8587d41d19b7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18986/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Quickly spread meringue over ice cream and cake, swirling in decorative patterns if desired. Freeze for 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/It6SGGnfvpaYT9QujzxFpU0nTlU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18986-baked-alaska-ddmfs-045-step5-7562e7cc82c54c8fb5c115827fcc6626.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18986/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake cake on the lowest oven shelf until meringue is light brown, 8 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bZboBKsb0WxK4LdZNMw-A7HEwlE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18986-baked-alaska-ddmfs-046-step6-760f4c28c82b456a8512219531045906.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18986/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
